	{
		{"text"},
		line=741,
	},
	{
		{"select", text="Go with Hotori."},
		{"select", text="Go with Akari."},
		{"select"},
		line=741,
	},
	{
		{"eval", exp="g.no122=1"},
		{"script", label="exit", cond="f.s!=1"},
		{"eval", exp="f.no153=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020150"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020200"},
		line=744,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Illumined by the flickering streetlamps, the peach flowers are still easily visible from the windows of our vehicle.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The Persica, later to blossom than in previous years, have finally reached full bloom.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Peach flowers at night are beautiful in their own way,\naren't they?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's a fairness to them that they lack by day.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shall we take a detour to admire them on the way home?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Excellent idea. I'll bet Kokuan hasn't seen them in a long while.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Akari answers my jest with a jest of her own.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Can't you two take this a little more seriously?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Behind us, Hotori heaves an exasperated sigh.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari's mouth only loosens up like this when she's nervous.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin started it...”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Stop squabbling, you two. You'll attract attention.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The vehicle falls silent save for the dim rumbling of the engine.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Akari and I are both on tenterhooks at the prospect of infiltrating the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Your fortitude is most impressive.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“To have the composure to still tell jokes right before an infiltration mission...”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Despite the vehicle's rumbling, Koyuzu does not look up from staring holes into her sketch of the palace grounds.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Incidentally, we're not riding in the usual shop van from Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Instead, we've commandeered a sleek construction van with a “Kurushima Construction” logo prominently painted along its side.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The area around the ceremony venue, where the bombing took place, is naturally cordoned off.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"With the exception of Kurushima Construction, which has been contracted to repair the wall, no other vehicles can approach the site without arousing suspicion.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Hotori managed to persuade Shino into lending us this vehicle.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"It was a risky move even for Shino, but according to Hotori, she agreed all too easily.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Cool beans. You totally owe me one, though.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That was awfully easy...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'll take it back if you're not satisfied.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please don't. We're seriously counting on it.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Don't get it twisted now, I really do love the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Half my blood may be Republican, but my heart belongs only to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I mean, nothing goes better with fried chicken and barbecue than rice, am I right?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yet you still want me to owe you one...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y'all have this saying that 'nothing costs so much as that which is freely given,' right?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I don't wanna hold it over you forever, so I gotta make sure you pay me back in full.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We'll be all square once you return the favor, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Depends on what you ask for...”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'll think long and carefully 'bout it.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I wooonder? Maybe I'll have you keep me company 'til the sun comes up?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How vulgar.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, feels good when you give it to me straight like that.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't you worry, my dear. I won't ask for anything unreasonable.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You'll probably end up feeling like you made away like a bandit.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I know you already agreed, but still, what'll you do if the Republican Army asks you about it?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Tell 'em the warriors stole it.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“This bad boy's got some nice insurance on it, so go ahead and wreck it all you want.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I sure wouldn't mind getting myself a new set of wheels. Hahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"All thanks to Shino, we pass the checkpoint into the Republican occupation without a problem.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Not a single one of the sentries with their eyes fixed on us says a word.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll have to thank Shino again when we get back.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shino never once told us to 'Be careful' or 'Come back\nalive.'”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She just put herself on the line and her trust in us.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Hotori’s grip tightens around the spellblade in her hands.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"It's the legenda",
{"ruby", text="Nameless Flame"},
"ry Shiranui.  ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"There isn't a warrior alive who doesn't know of it.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"This spellblade is the treasured heirloom of House Inou, its wielder the rightwise Executor of the warriors' will.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's a powerful-looking spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I gently hold back the hand Akari reaches out.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Never touch another's blade without their permission.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's a warrior's etiquette, so it's not your fault for not knowing.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Once we rescue my father, I'll get his permission.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, Shiranui belongs to you.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Once we rescue my father, it'll belong to him.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Hotori settles the matter all on her own, resolutely staring forward.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"She's not in the mood for any further discussion.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"As proof of her intentions, Hotori has brought along a second blade for herself.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Inou, once we get into the palace, can you let me go search for the Three Sacred Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Akari tells her the legends that we heard from Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“According to Kotone, the Ame no Mitsurugi is a spellblade with the power to cause cataclysms.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not just in the legends, but in actual recorded history.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You're kidding...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Hotori trails off with a gulp.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I suppose I wouldn't object to laying my eyes on it.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, I can only imagine what her patterning must look like...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, no, even if I'm unworthy to touch her, I'd be happy just to breathe the same air that she's touched...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um... Hotori-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah! My bad...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"As expected, Hotori completely forgets herself whenever the topic of blades comes up.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh, yeah, sure... You can play with it all you want afterwards.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“More importantly, though, assuming we can get our hands on the Ame no Mitsurugi, wouldn't that be a godsend for the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We might be able to beat the entire Republican Army with it!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But realistically speaking, it would be difficult for the Blades to conduct a future operation to retrieve the Three Sacred Treasures.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we're going to look for them, tonight is our only chance.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"If the Sworn Blades were to break into the Imperial Palace at a later date, it would be no different from starting an armed uprising.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"We would have no time to actually search for the Treasures.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you know where the Treasures are located?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's a temple deep in the palace called the Shireiden for the Emperor's private use only. They're probably inside there.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Hotori thinks for a few seconds.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not a bad idea.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we can get our hands on the Treasures, they'll be incredibly useful.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then it's decided.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"After a while, we arrive at the construction site at the base of the palace wall.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Alright, it's time.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes ma'am!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Koyuzu's wounds have been Healed by the manager to the point where they shouldn't interfere with her ability to carry out the mission.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"We quickly duck behind the construction curtain cordoning off the damaged section.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The hole in the wall is crudely blocked by a boulder at least twice my size.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stand back.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"With a flash, I unleash my spellblade...",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"...And carve a sizable hole in the newly patched stonework.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"All it takes is a slight push, and the nearby stone crumbles as well, expanding the entrance I made.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not half bad, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is normal.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're no fun! Why do I even bother?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, we're counting on you to lead the way.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"We clamber through the hole and emerge in a well-maintained corridor.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“It seems this passage is frequently traveled.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Our faces all stiffen with tension.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"There's no telling when we might run into the Forbidden Guard.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This area's an emergency exit.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I played hide-and-seek around here all the time when I was little.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where's the dungeon?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“This way, I believe. Based on the structure, there should be empty space this way.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Plus, I can faintly hear sounds from this direction.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Koyuzu murmurs, the animal ears above her head twitching slightly.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Koyuzu? I've been wondering, but what are those things?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Oh, these?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Koyuzu asks, absently stroking the ears on her head and the tail on her behind.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"She looks just like a fox taken human form.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“These are a product of my spellblade's magicks, or perhaps it would be more accurate to call it a side effect.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“In exchange for heightening my senses to become as acute as one, I receive these animal features in turn.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Can I touch them?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Not during the operation, please. I'll end up making strange noises.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Koyuzu hastily scurries forward, keeping her distance from Akari.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"After moving in silence for some time, we come across a fork in the road.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"We've managed to entirely avoid encountering the Forbidden Guard as of now.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know we're underground, but isn't this still a little too quiet?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The last time we came to the palace, there wasn't even room for an ant to crawl around without being noticed.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Could this be a trap?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"We all exchange uneasy glances.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's keep moving, but keep your guard up.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, what path should we take?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“The dungeon can be found straight ahead, and if we climb these stairs, we should find ourselves within the depths of the palace.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like this is as far as we go together.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm going after the Three Sacred Treasures.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm going after my father.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The two of them share a nod.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, come with me.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you go with Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“As you wish, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold it. I'll be fine on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you stay with Hotori. It'll be bad news if you run into Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You don't need to worry about me.”",
